lum.dtl: newly added decision table-based land use management, the format is referred to lum.dtl. Created by Liang-Jun Zhu, 10/07/2025
12

name                     conds      alts      acts       !Continuous Hay, hay cutting (biomass harv) when plant heat units > 0.5 - soil is below 2*fc - and biomass is > 2500 kg/ha - max 4 cuttings per year
pl_hv_conthay_6yrs           8         6         4  
var                        obj   obj_num           lim_var            lim_op     lim_const      alt1      alt2      alt3      alt4      alt5      alt6
phu_base0                  hru         0              null                 -       0.15000         >         -         -         -         -         -       !base0 heat units to trigger plant
phu_base0                  hru         0              null                 -       0.30000         -         >         -         -         -         -       !plant even if soil water is high
soil_water                 hru         0                fc                 *       2.00000         <         -         <         <         -         -       !soil water < this value * field capacity
phu_plant                  hru         0           phu_mat                 -       0.50000         -         -         >         >         -         -       !plant heat units > this value
biomass                    hru         0              null                 -    2500.00000         -         -         >         >         -         -       !biomass > this value (kg/ha) 
year_rot                   hru         0              null                 -       1.00000         =         =         -         -         -         -       !plant in the first year of the rotation
year_rot                   hru         0              null                 -       6.00000         -         -         <         =         =         >       !hay cutting (biomass harv) in each year and then reset rotation after the 6th year
jday                       hru         0              null                 -     350.00000         -         -         -         -         =         -       !make sure to kill hay in the 6th year     
act_typ                    obj   obj_num              name            option         const        const2                fp  outcome
plant                      hru         0         plant_hay              alfa       0.00000       1.00000              null  y   y   n   n   n   n             
harvest                    hru         0          harv_hay              alfa       0.00000       4.00000       hay_cut_low  n   n   y   y   n   n   
kill                       hru         0          kill_hay              alfa       0.00000       1.00000              null  n   n   n   n   y   n    
rot_reset                  hru         0           reset_1              null       1.00000       1.00000              null  n   n   n   n   n   y    

name                     conds      alts      acts       !Continuous Corn sequence, plant and harvest for continuous corn, plant before May 30 and harvest before Oct 31.
pl_hv_contcorn               7         6         3  
var                        obj   obj_num           lim_var            lim_op     lim_const      alt1      alt2      alt3      alt4      alt5      alt6  
phu_base0                  hru         0              null                 -       0.15000         >         -         -         -         -         -       !base0 heat units to trigger plant
phu_base0                  hru         0              null                 -       0.30000         -         -         -         -         >         -       !plant even if soil water is high
phu_plant                  hru         0           phu_mat                 -       1.15000         -         >         -         -         -         -       !plant heat units to trigger harvest
soil_water                 hru         0                fc                 *       2.00000         <         <         -         -         -         -       !don't schedule if too wet
jday                       hru         0              null                 -     150.00000         -         -         -         -         -         =       !plant even other factors are not qualified, May 30
jday                       hru         0              null                 -     304.00000         -         -         =         -         -         -       !harvest day even if too wet, Oct 31
year_rot                   hru         0              null                 -       1.00000         -         -         -         >         -         -       !reset rotation each year
act_typ                    obj   obj_num              name            option         const        const2                fp  outcome           
plant                      hru         0        plant_corn           corn120       0.00000       1.00000              null  y   n   n   n   y   y   
harvest_kill               hru         0         harv_corn           corn120       0.00000       1.00000             grain  n   y   y   n   n   n   
rot_reset                  hru         0           reset_1              null       1.00000       1.00000              null  n   n   n   y   n   n 

name                     conds      alts      acts       !Cash grain (6-year-rotation of corn and soybean)
pl_hv_cashgrain_6yrs         9        13         5  
var                        obj   obj_num           lim_var            lim_op     lim_const      alt1      alt2      alt3      alt4      alt5      alt6      alt7      alt8      alt9     alt10      alt11     alt12     alt13     
phu_base0                  hru         0              null                 -       0.15000         >         >         >         -         -         -         >         >         >         -         -         -         -       !base0 heat units to trigger plant
phu_plant                  hru         0           phu_mat                 -       1.15000         -         -         -         >         >         >         -         -         -         >         >         >         -       !plant heat units > this value to trigger harvest
soil_water                 hru         0                fc                 *       2.00000         <         <         <         <         <         <         <         <         <         <         <         <         -       !soil water < this value * field capacity
year_rot                   hru         0              null                 -       1.00000         =         -         -         =         -         -         -         -         -         -         -         -         -       !plant and harvest corn grain in the 1st year
year_rot                   hru         0              null                 -       2.00000         -         -         -         -         -         -         =         -         -         =         -         -         -       !plant and harvest soybean in the 2nd year
year_rot                   hru         0              null                 -       3.00000         -         =         -         -         =         -         -         -         -         -         -         -         -       !plant and harvest corn grain in the 3rd year
year_rot                   hru         0              null                 -       4.00000         -         -         -         -         -         -         -         =         -         -         =         -         -       !plant and harvest soybean in the 4th year
year_rot                   hru         0              null                 -       5.00000         -         -         =         -         -         =         -         -         -         -         -         -         -       !plant and harvest corn grain in the 5th year
year_rot                   hru         0              null                 -       6.00000         -         -         -         -         -         -         -         -         =         -         -         =         >       !plant and harvest soybean in the 6th year and then reset rotation
act_typ                    obj   obj_num              name            option         const        const2                fp  outcome
plant                      hru         0        plant_corn           corn120       0.00000       1.00000              null  y   y   y   n   n   n   n   n   n   n   n   n   n
harvest_kill               hru         0         harv_corn           corn120       0.00000       1.00000             grain  n   n   n   y   y   y   n   n   n   n   n   n   n
plant                      hru         0        plant_soyb           soyb120       0.00000       1.00000              null  n   n   n   n   n   n   y   y   y   n   n   n   n            
harvest_kill               hru         0         harv_soyb           soyb120       0.00000       1.00000             grain  n   n   n   n   n   n   n   n   n   y   y   y   n
rot_reset                  hru         0           reset_1              null       1.00000       1.00000              null  n   n   n   n   n   n   n   n   n   n   n   n   y  

