name                     conds      alts      acts       !Tillage 1 for cash grain and continuous corn: Chisel plow after harvesting in fall, and twice field cultivator before planting in spring
tillage_1                    3         3         3  
var                        obj   obj_num           lim_var            lim_op     lim_const      alt1      alt2      alt3  
phu_base0                  hru         0              null                 -       0.10000         >         -         -       !first field cultivator often occurrs couple weeks before planting
phu_base0                  hru         0              null                 -       0.14000         -         >         -       !second field cultivator occurrs couple days before or in the same day with planting
days_harv                  hru         0              null                 -       5.00000         -         -         =       !days after harvest to chisel plow
act_typ                    obj   obj_num              name            option         const        const2                fp  outcome           
till                       hru         0     fieldcultivat           fldcult       0.00000       1.00000              null  y   n   n   
till                       hru         0     fieldcultivat           fldcult       0.00000       1.00000              null  n   y   n   
till                       hru         0       chisel_plow          chisplow       0.00000       1.00000              null  n   n   y   

