days_harv                  hru         0              null                 -       5.00000         -         =       !days after harvest to chisel plow
act_typ                    obj   obj_num              name            option         const        const2                fp  outcome           
till                       hru         0     fieldcultivat           fldcult       0.00000       1.00000              null  y   n
till                       hru         0       chisel_plow          chisplow       0.00000       1.00000              null  n   y   

